      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(-x)&=|-x+1|-|-x-1|\\\\f(-x)&=|x-1|-|x+1|\\\\f(-x)&=-\\bigl(|x+1|-|x-1|\\bigr)\\\\f(-x)&=-f(x).\\end{align*}$$\nThis holds for every $x\\in\\mathbb{R}$, so $f$ is odd.",
